  /// The name of the utilization metric.
  pub name: RDSDBMetricName? = None
  /// The statistic of the utilization metric. The Compute Optimizer API,
  /// Command Line Interface (CLI), and SDKs return utilization metrics using
  /// only the Maximum statistic, which is the highest value observed during
  /// the specified period. The Compute Optimizer console displays graphs for
  /// some utilization metrics using the Average statistic, which is the value
  /// of Sum / SampleCount during the specified period. For more information,
  /// see Viewing resource recommendations in the Compute Optimizer User Guide
  /// . You can also get averaged utilization metric data for your resources
  /// using Amazon CloudWatch. For more information, see the Amazon CloudWatch
  /// User Guide .
  pub statistic: RDSDBMetricStatistic? = None
  /// The value of the utilization metric.
  pub value: Float? = None
}

